## Commands

Always use the Makefile. It is what CI runs.

| Command | What it does |
| --- | --- |
| `make doctor` | Check that required tools are installed |
| `make setup` | Install dependencies |
| `make build` | Build |
| `make fmt` | Format code in place |
| `make lint` | Format check, linters, type checks |
| `make test` | Run tests |
| `make security` | Secrets (gitleaks), SAST (semgrep), dependency audit, filesystem scan (trivy) |
| `make check` | Everything above. **Must pass before you say a task is done.** |

